Doctor of Education, Doctor of Juridical Science, }{\cf1\insrsid3308450\charrsid15034624 and }{\cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 Doctor of Public Health in any field such as}{\cf1\insrsid3308450\charrsid15034624  arts, sciences, }{
\cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 education, engineering, }{\cf1\insrsid3308450\charrsid15034624 business, and }{\cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 public administration.
\par }{\i\cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 First-professional}{\cf1\insrsid9600684\charrsid15034624 
: includes the fields of dentistry (DDS or DMD), medicine (MD), optometry (OD), osteopathic medicine (DO), pharmacy (DPharm or BPharm), podiatric medicine (DPM), veterinary medicine (DVM), chiropractic (DC or DCM),
 law (JD) and theological professions (MDiv, MHL).
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1263555 {\i\cf1\insrsid1263555\charrsid6750727 Terminal master\rquote s degree}{\cf1\insrsid1263555\charrsid6750727 : a master\rquote 
